          "files": [
            "src/main.cpp"
          ],
          "retained": [
            "Pair boundaries along the smaller matrix dimension, incrementally accumulate rolling bands, and block-transpose tall matrices for contiguous scans.",
            "Use a reusable power-of-two open-addressed frequency table with signed 64-bit keys and counts plus generation stamps.",
            "Parallelize independent band starts with cyclic static scheduling and a 64-bit answer reduction, retaining a work threshold for small inputs.",
            "Apply SIMD to independent band-accumulator elements while keeping the prefix-frequency scan sequential."
          ]
        },
